# smart-enter — шаги записи (что показывается — smart-enter.md)
# Его замечание 2026-10-05: показать все режимы Prefix on the new line. Заметка — номер и буллет рядом,
# чтобы Numbered lines only было видно на обоих.
title Smart Enter | A new line below without splitting the one you are on
open Smart enter.md
# Его слово 2026-10-06: «субтитры прыгают» — субтитр у низа окна, запас под строки, которые прибавит Enter.
room 80
sub bottom
caret 1. Buy milk and bread @ and
stage Default Obsidian
say Obsidian: Enter splits the line
key Enter
expect 1. Buy milk / 2. and bread / 3. Pick up the parcel

stage Smart Enter
say Smart Enter → on
settings Keyboard
set Smart Enter = on
caret 1. Buy milk and bread @ and
say Enter → a new line below, this one stays whole
key Enter
type Call the vet
expect 1. Buy milk and bread / 2. Call the vet / 3. Pick up the parcel
caret - call the vet @ vet
say The new line takes the same marker
key Enter
type book a visit
expect - call the vet / - book a visit / - ring the bank

stage Prefix: None
say Prefix on the new line → None
settings Keyboard
set Prefix on the new line = None
caret 1. Buy milk and bread @ and
say Enter → the new line starts bare
key Enter
type Call the vet
expect 1. Buy milk and bread / Call the vet / 2. Pick up the parcel

stage Prefix: Numbered lines only
say Prefix on the new line → Numbered lines only
settings Keyboard
set Prefix on the new line = Numbered lines only
caret 1. Buy milk and bread @ and
say A numbered line → the next number
key Enter
type Call the vet
caret - call the vet @ vet
say A bullet line → the new line starts bare
key Enter
type book a visit
expect 2. Call the vet / 3. Pick up the parcel / ## Calls / - call the vet / book a visit / - ring the bank

stage Use Shift+Enter
say Use Shift+Enter instead → on
settings Keyboard
set Use Shift+Enter instead = on
caret 2. Pick up the parcel @ the
say Enter splits as usual
key Enter
caret 1. Buy milk and bread @ and
say Shift+Enter → a new line below
key Shift+Enter
expect 1. Buy milk and bread / 2. / 3. Pick up / 4. the parcel
